  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing the Jordanian National Action Plan on Women, Peace and Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JONAP II : The program&#x2019;s overall objective is to support and strengthen the Jordanian government and stakeholders to implement the country&#x2019;s women, peace and security commitments and contribute to Jordan&#x2019;s stability and security through the increased and meaningful participation of youth and women to maintain peace and security. To also address gender-specific needs in the context of the COVID-19 pandemic including widely spread gender-based violence and domestic violence.</narrative>
  </description>
